# Review/session artefacts and CI config: none of them are build inputs, and
# .superpowers in particular holds task reports containing real generated
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD values. The final image copies only /out/ekokod, so these
# never ship — but they would still enter the build context and the build
# cache, which a --cache-to export or a remote daemon exposes.
.superpowers
coverage.out
HANDOFF_NEXT_SESSION.md
.github
